{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>All of them.</b> An allusion to your sons and your daughters, whom He will mention. And it is possible that \"all of them\" is a sign for the kings." "<b>They shall be nursed.</b> From the root of ויהי אומן את הדסה (Esther 2:7)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 60, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:24.009336722Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}